					"content": "Youngsters, we meet again. What would you like to know this time?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220360502,
						220360503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Konda Densuke"
				},
				{
					"id": 220360502,
					"content": "I'm not here to ask questions this time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220360504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220360504,
					"content": "Oh, did Vahid send you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220360505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Konda Densuke"
				},
				{
					"id": 220360505,
					"content": "I heard about a novel fertilizer shop in Ritou. That's why I went to meet Mr. Vahid to try out his fertilizer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220360506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Konda Densuke"
				},
				{
					"id": 220360506,
					"content": "If it works and increases crop production, there might be hope for restoring Konda Village.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220360507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Konda Densuke"
				},
				{
					"id": 220360507,
					"content": "Heh, I guess it is still up to an old relic such as myself to restore the village. Those young lads from the village... Hmph! You can't count on them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220360508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Konda Densuke"
				},
				{
					"id": 220360508,
					"content": "Alright, tell me then. How should I use this fertilizer?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220360509,
						220360510,
						220360511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Konda Densuke"
				},
				{
					"id": 220360509,
					"content": "Add water first, then add crushed leaves before mixing them up.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						220360512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 220360512,
					"content": "Such a complicated procedure for fertilizer... Alright, I've got it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Konda Densuke"
				},
				{
					"id": 220360510,
					"content": "Add crushed leaves first, then mix them, and add water at the end.",
